==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|en-au-cross the line.ogg|Audio (AU)}}

===Verb===
{{head|en|verb|head=[[cross]] the [[line]]}}

# To cross the [[equator]], as a [[vessel]] at [[sea]].
# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} To [[overstep]] a [[boundary]], [[rule]], or [[limit]]; to go too far or do something unacceptable.
#: {{ux|en|I can tolerate a lot, but they really '''crossed the line''' when they broke the equipment.}}
# {{lb|en|cinematography}} to film from the opposite side of an imaginary axis on set in order to view the actors from the opposite direction.

